    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "Goal\r\nOur goal is to develop a virtual reality application that not
    only teaches the steps and movements of Lerion and Cari\xF1osa but also provides
    a deeper understanding of the cultural history behind these dances. By offering
    an engaging and interactive platform, we aim to bridge the gap between modern
    technology and traditional art forms, fostering appreciation and participation
    across generations.\r\n"
