  m_Text: "Mission\r\nOur mission is to preserve and promote the rich cultural heritage
    of Filipino folk dances, particularly the Lerion and Cari\xF1osa, through innovative
    virtual reality experiences. We aim to make traditional dance education accessible
    and immersive, empowering users to engage deeply with the dances while appreciating
    their cultural significance.\r\n"
