    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "Cultural Context: Cari\xF1osa: A Dance of Romance and Heritage\n\nOverview:
    Cari\xF1osa is a cherished Filipino folk dance with deep Spanish roots, symbolizing
    the rich cultural exchange during the colonial period. Originating on Panay Island,
    this dance blends traditional Spanish elements with Filipino customs, offering
    a vibrant representation of the country's historical and cultural tapestry.\n"
